2168, "w": 44, "h": 33}]}
{"page": 300, "width": 1600, "lines": [{"t": "ULTIMATEPHRASALVERB", "x": 111, "y": 124, "w": 518, "h": 31}, {"t": "THE", "x": 39, "y": 124, "w": 86, "h": 31}, {"t": "BOOK", "x": 643, "y": 126, "w": 106, "h": 30}, {"t": "41", "x": 1384, "y": 123, "w": 107, "h": 85}, {"t": "Infinitive", "x": 39, "y": 227, "w": 115, "h": 39}, {"t": "two-word phrasal verbs with the particle in that require into when used with an object", "x": 1457, "y": 230, "w": 31, "h": 906}, {"t": "-ing form", "x": 664, "y": 268, "w": 111, "h": 36}, {"t": "present tense", "x": 229, "y": 272, "w": 159, "h": 29}, {"t": "past tense", "x": 963, "y": 272, "w": 121, "h": 30}, {"t": "past participle", "x": 1231, "y": 273, "w": 169, "h": 32}, {"t": "break in", "x": 39, "y": 312, "w": 103, "h": 38}, {"t": "breaking in", "x": 663, "y": 344, "w": 131, "h": 35}, {"t": "break in & breaks in", "x": 196, "y": 346, "w": 236, "h": 29}, {"t": "broke in", "x": 972, "y": 343, "w": 100, "h": 31}, {"t": "broken in", "x": 1256, "y": 346, "w": 114, "h": 31}, {"t": "1. break in/into p.v. When you break in or break into a place, you enter illegally.", "x": 132, "y": 428, "w": 1147, "h": 36}, {"t": "using force or deception.", "x": 131, "y": 468, "w": 356, "h": 31}, {"t": "A thief broke in and stole my TV.", "x": 183, "y": 525, "w": 442, "h": 35}, {"t": "When I saw the smashed glass in the street, I knew my car had been broken into.", "x": 184, "y": 567, "w": 1080, "h": 38}, {"t": "break-in n. A break-in is an illegal entry into a place using force or deception.", "x": 129, "y": 639, "w": 1110, "h": 41}, {"t": "The police investigated a break-in at the supermarket.", "x": 180, "y": 700, "w": 735, "h": 39}, {"t": "2. break ...in p.v. When you break in a new. mechanical device or a car, you use it", "x": 128, "y": 773, "w": 1171, "h": 35}, {"t": "slowly and carefully until you are sure it ready for heavier use. When you break in a", "x": 129, "y": 809, "w": 1173, "h": 38}, {"t": "pair of shoes, you wear them only occasionally and for a short time until they are", "x": 130, "y": 851, "w": 1129, "h": 30}, {"t": "comfortable. When you break in people at a new job, you train and supervise them", "x": 128, "y": 884, "w": 1177, "h": 37}, {"t": "and give them less than the normal amount of work until they are ready for", "x": 132, "y": 923, "w": 1056, "h": 32}, {"t": "something more difficult.", "x": 132, "y": 961, "w": 363, "h": 30}, {"t": "I don't want to wear these boots on the expedition. I haven't broken them in yet.", "x": 185, "y": 1019, "w": 1075, "h": 32}, {"t": "We're breaking in a new secretary, so things have been a bit confused at our", "x": 183, "y": 1059, "w": 1027, "h": 38}, {"t": "office lately.", "x": 224, "y": 1103, "w": 165, "h": 38}, {"t": "broken in part.adj. After you break in a new mechanical device or a car, a pair", "x": 133, "y": 1176, "w": 1104, "h": 33}, {"t": "of shoes, or people at a new job, they are broken in.", "x": 134, "y": 1214, "w": 729, "h": 32}, {"t": "I don't want to wear those shoes to the dance. They're not broken in yet.", "x": 187, "y": 1274, "w": 966, "h": 31}, {"t": "check in", "x": 43, "y": 1324, "w": 102, "h": 34}, {"t": "checking in", "x": 674, "y": 1355, "w": 127, "h": 31}, {"t": "checked in", "x": 969, "y": 1353, "w": 121, "h": 33}, {"t": "check in & checks in", "x": 203, "y": 1359, "w": 236, "h": 26}, {"t": "checked in", "x": 1258, "y": 1355, "w": 119, "h": 30}, {"t": "1. check in/into p.v. When you arrive at a hotel and arrange for a room, you check in", "x": 136, "y": 1441, "w": 1198, "h": 32}, {"t": "or check into the hotel.", "x": 135, "y": 1478, "w": 340, "h": 34}, {"t": "After I arrive in Denver, I'll go straight to my hotel and check in.", "x": 187, "y": 1538, "w": 845, "h": 35}, {"t": "Jim checked into the hotel while I called home to check on the kids.", "x": 190, "y": 1581, "w": 901, "h": 33}, {"t": "2. check ...in p.v. When you arrive at an airport and give your ticket to an agent and", "x": 135, "y": 1653, "w": 1206, "h": 37}, {"t": "receive a boarding pass, you check in.", "x": 137, "y": 1695, "w": 537, "h": 30}, {"t": "You should check in at least two hours before your flight.", "x": 191, "y": 1752, "w": 763, "h": 36}, {"t": "You can wait over there in the lobby while I check you in.", "x": 192, "y": 1795, "w": 759, "h": 36}, {"t": "receive a boarding pass is the check-in or the check-in counter. The process of", "x": 135, "y": 1905, "w": 1115, "h": 35}, {"t": "checking in is check-in.", "x": 137, "y": 1944, "w": 350, "h": 33}, {"t": "Before your flight you have to go to the check-in counter.", "x": 191, "y": 2000, "w": 770, "h": 40}, {"t": "3. check ...in p.v. When you give your luggage to an airline agent so that it will be", "x": 136, "y": 2075, "w": 1176, "h": 36}, {"t": "check it in.", "x": 136, "y": 2155, "w": 162, "h": 31}, {"t": "315", "x": 1442, "y": 2167, "w": 45, "h": 33}]}
